Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.93,0:00:22.39,Flashback,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,Tanonaka... We have a guest?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.39,0:00:25.34,Flashback,Seraphiel,0,0,0,,Actually, I'm not quite sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.53,0:00:29.33,Flashback,Seraphiel,0,0,0,,He says he wants to \N"hear the calls of God".
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.93,0:00:34.24,Flashback,Kou,0,0,0,,I've never had much interest \Nin this mundane world,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.24,0:00:37.48,Flashback,Kou,0,0,0,,which is why I didn't hesitate \Nto create the envelopes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.30,0:00:41.98,Flashback,Kou,0,0,0,,But ever since then, He hasn't called to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.89,0:00:45.24,Flashback,Seraphiel,0,0,0,,We're here to listen, if you'd like.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.24,0:00:49.72,Flashback,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,Sure, maybe He was the one \Nwho led you here today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.61,0:00:59.50,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,{\i1}What we heard that day was inconceivable.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.59,0:01:16.51,Show Title,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\pos(320,110)}Tasuketsu: Fate of the Majority
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.08,0:02:34.52,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,{\i1}This man named Kou Kirishima claimed{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.52,0:02:39.94,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,{\i1}he succeeded in calling spirits \Ninto existence 13 years ago.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.50,0:02:45.70,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,{\i1}He heard God's call and became \NHis subject, and ever since,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.70,0:02:51.23,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,{\i1}he was connected to His world, \Nin the domain of the spirits and mind.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.08,0:02:57.37,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,{\i1}And with His guidance, \Nhe created the Mother Light,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.37,0:02:59.63,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,{\i1}the ultra space-time \Nconstruction interference device.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.38,0:03:04.79,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,{\i1}He used its powers to collect \Nthe greed of humanity,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.79,0:03:07.96,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,{\i1}enclosed it into envelopes as \N"Prime Rights" and "Rights",{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.51,0:03:10.91,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,{\i1}and drew them into this world.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.65,0:03:18.68,Flashback,Kou,0,0,0,,But... from the moment I gave the envelopes \Nto my father, He ceased to call upon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.46,0:03:25.25,Flashback,Kou,0,0,0,,In the near future, there will be many \Nfraudulent gods who possess various powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.00,0:03:29.19,Flashback,Kou,0,0,0,,If that incurred the wrath of God...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.85,0:03:34.87,Flashback,Kou,0,0,0,,I want to recover the Rights \Nand return them to the Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.22,0:03:40.61,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,{\i1}I couldn't comprehend any of it.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.33,0:03:43.95,Comp small -an9,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,{\pos(325,50)\fad(260,1)\an8}You are currently looking\Nat this screen
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.37,0:03:44.94,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,{\i1}But it didn't take long for me to understand.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.47,0:03:52.18,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,{\i1}Seraphiel and I were spared from Tasuketsu \Nthanks to the Mother's abilities.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.62,0:03:54.09,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,{\i1}And then...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.70,0:03:58.04,Flashback,Seraphiel,0,0,0,,Oh, welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.54,0:04:01.63,Flashback,Seraphiel,0,0,0,,How was the Camp? \NDid you find any resources?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.63,0:04:06.78,Flashback,Kou,0,0,0,,Information on the Rights \Nwas mostly redacted.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.47,0:04:08.88,Flashback,Kou,0,0,0,,But more importantly...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.62,0:04:13.38,Flashback,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,I can't believe it. Teppei \Nand Haruto were test subjects.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.86,0:04:17.44,Flashback,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,And how is it possible \Nthat Haruto is the Emperor?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.09,0:04:22.22,Flashback,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,The Emperor died and their Rights \Nwere returned to the Mother, weren't they?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.78,0:04:24.93,Flashback,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,Then Haruto is already...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.93,0:04:26.38,Flashback,Kou,0,0,0,,Kisaragi-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.41,0:04:30.77,Flashback,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,I've made up my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.62,0:04:34.49,Flashback,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,I'll get Haruto and Teppei back!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.49,0:04:36.73,Flashback,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,Even if I have to become the devil himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.51,0:04:40.93,Flashback,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,There may be a Right to revive Haruto.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.93,0:04:44.16,Flashback,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,And the Obedience Right \Nhasn't been returned to the Mother,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.16,0:04:45.96,Flashback,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,which means Teppei is still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.96,0:04:50.06,Flashback,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,If I can just find him, we can use \Nhis Obedience Right to save Haruto!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.63,0:04:54.47,Flashback,Seraphiel,0,0,0,,Then you'll need a priest.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.47,0:04:55.40,Flashback,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.89,0:04:58.10,Flashback,Seraphiel,0,0,0,,We've been on this journey \Ntogether for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.92,0:05:02.99,Flashback,Seraphiel,0,0,0,,I understand your love for family very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.55,0:05:09.36,Flashback,Seraphiel,0,0,0,,When all of this is over, \NI'll forgive your sins in the name of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.76,0:05:12.12,Flashback,Seraphiel,0,0,0,,And we can celebrate your love \Nand bless you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.83,0:05:15.84,Flashback,Kou,0,0,0,,Then I'll lend you my help, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.34,0:05:18.83,Flashback,Kou,0,0,0,,"Maybe He was the one who led you here."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.41,0:05:20.74,Flashback,Kou,0,0,0,,Remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.48,0:05:24.33,Flashback,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,Kou. Tanonaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.18,0:05:26.40,Flashback,Seraphiel,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.73,0:05:30.77,Flashback,Seraphiel,0,0,0,,From now on, I'm no longer Tanonaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.30,0:05:33.15,Flashback,Seraphiel,0,0,0,,Seraphiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.15,0:05:36.33,Flashback,Seraphiel,0,0,0,,For the sake of Kou's wishes, and yours,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.33,0:05:39.39,Flashback,Seraphiel,0,0,0,,I will pray for blessings on you\Nand forgiveness of your sins
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.39,0:05:41.20,Flashback,Seraphiel,0,0,0,,as the "Angel of Prayer".
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.54,0:05:43.22,Flashback,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,Seraphiel...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.75,0:05:46.74,Flashback,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,Then from now I'll be...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.33,0:05:52.57,Flashback,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,The Empress... No, the Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.91,0:05:57.89,Flashback,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,The precursor to the Empress, waiting for\N the Emperor to abdicate his throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.78,0:06:02.38,Flashback,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,I swear to find the two of them! \NAnd save them!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.01,0:06:07.14,Flashback,Kou,0,0,0,,You'll need some faithful servants.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.28,0:06:12.46,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,{\i1}Over a month later,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.94,0:06:16.36,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,{\i1}our efforts finally bear fruit.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.92,0:06:19.82,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,Glad you're here, Raion.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.13,0:06:21.71,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,We're all gathered then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.24,0:06:25.32,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,Now let's hear where Teppei is... Iruga.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.63,0:06:28.88,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,The person we were looking for \Nwas my big brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.88,0:06:31.59,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,We've been waiting for you \Nto hear his whereabouts, Raion!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.59,0:06:34.04,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Wow, that's quite the honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.04,0:06:36.54,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Ready for the big reveal?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.54,0:06:38.50,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Teppei-chan is...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.50,0:06:40.17,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,...at the Emperor's tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.17,0:06:45.22,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,He already died during Tasuketsu's test run, \Nand he's become part of the tower itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.10,0:06:54.22,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Big bro...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.86,0:06:55.98,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,It's all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.96,0:07:01.19,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,Iruga said that Teppei didn't \Nuse the Obedience Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.19,0:07:07.16,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Yeah, because he didn't want to endorse \Nthe Camp's actions by using his powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.16,0:07:12.43,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,So instead, he used it to prevent \Nforfeiture of the Obedience Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.43,0:07:14.41,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,sounds like something Teppei would do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.04,0:07:18.53,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,Seraphiel is waiting for us, \Nready to celebrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.53,0:07:20.29,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,Ready, Haruto?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.74,0:07:25.37,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,{\i1}Compound Exercise of the Rights!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.37,0:07:26.97,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Creator's Command"!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.43,0:07:33.68,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,{\i1}Prime Right of Recovery!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.36,0:07:36.64,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,{\i1}Recover the body of Teppei Yoshii!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.66,0:07:38.91,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,{\i1}Resynthesize!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.19,0:07:46.65,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,Teppei!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.19,0:07:46.65,Default-Top,Emperor,0,0,0,,Big bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.38,0:07:51.51,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.27,0:07:54.90,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,Let's hurry back to the church \Nand revive him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.90,0:07:57.54,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,The ultimate blessing is waiting for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.93,0:07:58.71,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,Meguru.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.71,0:07:59.54,Default,Meguru,0,0,0,,Yes, milady!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.93,0:08:01.67,Default,Meguru,0,0,0,,Prime Right of Exchange!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.05,0:08:08.17,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.17,0:08:13.28,Default,Meguru,0,0,0,,Milady, I've been transporting by \Nexchanging places with designated landmarks,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.28,0:08:16.02,Default,Meguru,0,0,0,,but I'm not able to exercise \Nexchange with the next landmark.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.02,0:08:18.48,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Because we took the liberty of removing it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.42,0:08:23.65,Default,Ikusa,0,0,0,,There's been an explosion \Nat the church's warehouse!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.61,0:08:27.67,Default,Mutsuki,0,0,0,,We may have been exposed to their attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.67,0:08:32.49,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Seraphiel's taking a look now, so \Nyou might wanna wait for his response.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.18,0:08:35.13,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.13,0:08:38.08,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,I was just checking the time and...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.33,0:08:40.08,Phone,Sign,0,0,0,,{\frz9\pos(110,174)\c&H77746C&}We've lit the signal fire.\NAll members attack the Queen's \Nquarters! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.50,0:08:40.08,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,...I saw their message!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.21,0:08:42.08,Black-Standard,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H5A4F3F&}We've lit the signal fire.\NAll members attack the Queen's \Nquarters! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.63,0:08:42.08,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,I knew it was them!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.61,0:08:45.64,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,I guess I was right to steal a device
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.64,0:08:48.30,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,so we could intercept messages \Nbetween core members.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.05,0:08:51.18,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,{\i1}Even considering Seraphiel's competence,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.18,0:08:53.87,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,{\i1}leaving him the entire enemy army is risky.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.87,0:08:56.56,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,They're based in Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.56,0:09:00.14,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,If they were to invade the church, \Nthey'd be coming from the south.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.14,0:09:02.40,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,Breakup towards the south \Nand intercept their attacks!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.40,0:09:03.65,Default,Ikusa,0,0,0,,Roger that!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.04,0:09:05.86,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,Iruga, be on the lookout for Yagihashi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.86,0:09:09.07,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Oh boy, you think that highly of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.07,0:09:10.57,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,That's touching.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.57,0:09:14.28,Default,Kisaragi,0,0,0,,Iruga, Ikusa, Meguru, Mutsuki... Off you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.28,0:09:15.44,Default-Top,Mutsuki,0,0,0,,As you wish!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.28,0:09:15.44,Default,Meguru,0,0,0,,Yes, milady!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.63,0:09:19.45,Default,Kai,0,0,0,,Um, Your Majesty? Does that mean I go too?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.45,0:09:21.37,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.37,0:09:23.25,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Kai Kasai! Go attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.25,0:09:24.50,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,I'll go too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.50,0:09:25.46,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.46,0:09:29.56,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,I may not have powers, but I know them best.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.56,0:09:31.43,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,I'm sure I can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.43,0:09:33.41,Default,Kai,0,0,0,,That'll be a relief!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.41,0:09:35.14,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,B-But Raion!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.47,0:09:37.89,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,I wanna do what I can for you too, Haruto.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.48,0:09:39.89,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Raion!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.39,0:09:44.28,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Promise me the three of you will stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.28,0:09:46.11,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,I don't want anything to happen to you, Haruto.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.11,0:09:48.57,Default,Emperor,0,0,0,,Yeah... I promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.57,0:09:50.32,Default,Kai,0,0,0,,All right, let's go Raion!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.32,0:09:51.38,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.03,0:09:55.91,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}A suicide mission, huh...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.16,0:10:00.53,Flashback,Sudo,0,0,0,,It's a mission with the best chance \Nto settle this once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.14,0:10:04.33,Flashback,Sudo,0,0,0,,First, we'll lead the Queen to the tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.33,0:10:09.59,Flashback,Sudo,0,0,0,,Most likely, she'll take the Emperor, \NKou, Meguru, and Ouno.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.59,0:10:11.34,Flashback,Sudo,0,0,0,,And Seraphiel will be left home.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.01,0:10:17.35,Flashback,Sudo,0,0,0,,Then, Iruga will place Yagihashi's original \Nbombs near the church and set them off.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.73,0:10:21.35,Flashback,Sudo,0,0,0,,Seraphiel will evacuate \Nthe rest of the Queen's servants
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.35,0:10:23.69,Flashback,Sudo,0,0,0,,and we'll lead them \Nto a designated location.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.16,0:10:27.64,Flashback,Sudo,0,0,0,,Finally, Ouno will show the Queen \Na message sent to this device
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.64,0:10:29.53,Flashback,Sudo,0,0,0,,and she'll order her officers to intercept.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.53,0:10:33.26,Flashback,Sudo,0,0,0,,Make sure to separate them \Nfrom the Queen, Emperor, and Kou.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.28,0:10:35.89,Flashback,Sudo,0,0,0,,And one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.89,0:10:38.35,Flashback,Sudo,0,0,0,,I have something for Ouno and Nihonyanagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.35,0:10:39.74,Flashback,Nishime,0,0,0,,Huh? Me too?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.04,0:10:41.23,Flashback,Sudo,0,0,0,,A parting gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.85,0:10:48.09,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,Around here should do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.09,0:10:49.98,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,{\i1}Space division.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.46,0:10:52.87,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,{\i1}I've been ordered to take Pres.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.87,0:10:56.05,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,{\i1}No change in plans for Ikusa \Nor Meguru, and no new Rights.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.05,0:10:58.85,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,{\i1}Meguru went west, Ikusa went southwest,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.85,0:11:01.53,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mutsuki went southeast, \Nand I'm taking the east.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.53,0:11:03.91,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kai's location will be traced \Nthrough Raion's GPS.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.91,0:11:05.77,Default,Iruga,0,0,0,,{\i1}And we're all set!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.40,0:11:07.85,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,His messages are coming in!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.85,0:11:10.15,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Presentation Right! Simultaneous transmission!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.15,0:11:12.74,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,All members attack your target!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.27,0:11:12.90,Black-Standard,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,1000)\fs30\c&H34342E&}All members attack your target!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.12,0:11:15.88,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,As planned, the enemy army has dispersed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.88,0:11:19.62,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,Find the enemy with the \Nbest prospects for your victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.18,0:11:28.46,Default,Meguru,0,0,0,,Bingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.51,0:11:37.43,Default,Ikusa,0,0,0,,The hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.42,0:11:41.10,Default,Ikusa,0,0,0,,What's this? Marbles?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.10,0:11:44.35,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,Endless duplication and maintenance \Nof the owner's "only remaining" object:
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.35,0:11:46.76,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,the Prime Right of Obtainment.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.19,0:11:50.64,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,I meant to trip you, but I guess I failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.64,0:11:53.14,Default,Ikusa,0,0,0,,You think I'm some idiot?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.14,0:11:54.78,Default,Ikusa,0,0,0,,Hey! Stop right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.75,0:12:01.45,Italics,Mutsuki,0,0,0,,Multiply the gravity within \Na ten-meter radius by...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.45,0:12:02.66,Italics,Mutsuki,0,0,0,,one thousand!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.04,0:12:15.46,Default,Mutsuki,0,0,0,,Delete target!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.02,0:12:17.98,Show Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(492,245)}Tasuketsu: Fate of the Majority
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.18,0:12:26.39,Default,Meguru,0,0,0,,Wha?! You're gonna run?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.39,0:12:30.58,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,Oops, am I too much for your \Nshort, stubby legs to catch up with?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.58,0:12:31.65,Default,Meguru,0,0,0,,Excuse me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.65,0:12:34.44,Default,Meguru,0,0,0,,I won't let you get away, stupid bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.70,0:12:36.36,Italics,Meguru,0,0,0,,Prime Right of Exchange!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.76,0:12:41.40,Default,Meguru,0,0,0,,Too bad...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.40,0:12:46.37,Default,Meguru,0,0,0,,Unlike you, I don't have to worry \Nabout running around all over the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.98,0:12:49.47,Default,Meguru,0,0,0,,Taking off again?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.47,0:12:50.75,Default,Meguru,0,0,0,,Knock it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.20,0:12:55.38,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,{\i1}According to Knight, the Exchange \NRight's range is 30 meters.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.38,0:12:59.27,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,{\i1}Changing locations doesn't necessarily \Nmean she'll catch up to me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.58,0:13:04.14,Default,Mutsuki,0,0,0,,Where is he hiding?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.78,0:13:09.88,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,{\i1}He can only control gravity \Nwithin a certain radius.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.88,0:13:11.90,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll be fine as long as I keep my distance.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.90,0:13:15.76,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,{\i1}Still! How can I defeat him \Nwithout getting close?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.76,0:13:19.04,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,{\i1}I better work fast, if I want to stall him!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.99,0:13:22.24,Default,Mutsuki,0,0,0,,{\i1}There!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.24,0:13:24.19,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,Dammit! How?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.53,0:13:30.00,Default,Mutsuki,0,0,0,,{\i1}My ability to listen to others' voices: \Nthe Right of Hearing.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.47,0:13:32.46,Default,Mutsuki,0,0,0,,{\i1}I should have used it sooner.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.07,0:13:36.09,Default,Mutsuki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Multiply gravity by 100 million!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.09,0:13:39.97,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.88,0:13:43.78,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,{\i1}Prioritize elevation over forward trajectory!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.05,0:13:48.23,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,{\i1}Shoot! I used my power!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.23,0:13:51.18,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's only a Right. He can \Nresist it with willpower.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.57,0:13:54.69,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,{\i1}If he caught on to that, I'm in trouble!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.28,0:13:56.87,Default,Mutsuki,0,0,0,,{\i1}He curved the trajectory?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.87,0:13:57.77,Default,Mutsuki,0,0,0,,{\i1}It must be a Right!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.54,0:14:00.35,Default,Mutsuki,0,0,0,,{\i1}No need to rush...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.35,0:14:03.62,Default,Mutsuki,0,0,0,,{\i1}First, I'll use willpower to see \Nif it's under the Permission Attribute.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.62,0:14:07.07,Default,Mutsuki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Then I can narrow down \Nits attribute and abilities.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.45,0:14:10.08,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,{\i1}Here goes nothing.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.51,0:14:17.88,Default,Meguru,0,0,0,,It's no use running!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.87,0:14:20.96,Default,Meguru,0,0,0,,See how easy that was?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.76,0:14:25.39,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,Don't get too cocky!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.83,0:14:33.69,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,I learned how to fight \Nfrom Saaya and Hayato!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.69,0:14:36.47,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,Don't you {\i1}dare{\i0} compare me \Nto the likes of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.31,0:14:54.45,Default,Meguru,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hikari?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.45,0:14:56.12,Default,Meguru,0,0,0,,{\i1}So she's been hiding this entire time!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.80,0:14:58.45,Default,Meguru,0,0,0,,{\i1}She's within my range.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.45,0:15:00.96,Default,Meguru,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't know what you were plotting, but...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.24,0:15:02.76,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.35,0:15:08.97,Default,Meguru,0,0,0,,That's what you get \Nfor betraying us, Hikari!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.18,0:15:13.02,Default,Meguru,0,0,0,,{\i1}Rubber?! A fake knife!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.59,0:15:15.69,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,{\i1}The initial blow is key \Nwith the Compliance Right.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.69,0:15:18.48,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,{\i1}The best chance of success \Ncomes down to the first try...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.48,0:15:20.89,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,Jump backwards exactly where you stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.89,0:15:21.52,Default,Meguru,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.44,0:15:34.72,Default,Mutsuki,0,0,0,,{\i1}I heard you... Over there!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.22,0:15:36.96,Default,Mutsuki,0,0,0,,Multiply gravity by 100 million!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.76,0:15:42.00,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,{\i1}I command the distinction between Rights \Nand Prime Rights and their limitations be...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.00,0:15:44.84,Black-Standard,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs30}Destroy
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.33,0:15:44.48,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,{\i1}...destroyed!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.84,0:15:46.14,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,{\i1}Prioritize...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.14,0:15:48.26,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,{\i1}...that building as his attack's target!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.37,0:15:52.60,Default,Mutsuki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Willpower has no effect.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.60,0:15:54.48,Default,Mutsuki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is it under the Transmutation Attribute?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.73,0:15:59.60,Default,Mutsuki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Either way, at this distance there's \Nno point in changing trajectory.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.60,0:16:02.57,Default,Mutsuki,0,0,0,,{\i1}As soon as I'm within range,{i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.26,0:16:04.57,Default,Mutsuki,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll crush him!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.11,0:16:12.08,Default,Mutsuki,0,0,0,,What?! It's not working?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.49,0:16:16.91,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,{\i1}Prioritizing my own physical safety \Npaid off big time!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.51,0:16:22.55,Default,Mutsuki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Fine, I'll exert my maximum \Nstrength of one trillion!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.55,0:16:23.51,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,{\i1}Here it comes!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.51,0:16:25.08,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is it!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.75,0:16:27.35,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,{\i1}Change the attack's target to...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.35,0:16:29.05,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,{\i1}Touya Mutsuki!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.39,0:16:31.55,Italics,Mutsuki,0,0,0,,Multiply gravity by a trillion!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.68,0:16:34.56,Black-Standard,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs40}Ultimate Prime Right of Priority
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.20,0:16:34.56,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ultimate Prime Right of Priority!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.71,0:16:48.17,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H0D1762&\bord0\shad0\fnArial Black\b1\}Miyagawa Sheet Metal Plant
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.50,0:16:51.65,Default,Ikusa,0,0,0,,There's no use hiding, four-eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.17,0:16:54.49,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,I'll resist until the very end!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.81,0:16:57.43,Default,Ikusa,0,0,0,,What a waste of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.97,0:17:11.29,Default,Ikusa,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.29,0:17:12.95,Default,Ikusa,0,0,0,,What the hell is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.77,0:17:16.00,Default,Ikusa,0,0,0,,A messenger bag?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.37,0:17:20.27,Default,Ikusa,0,0,0,,{\i1}So he's been producing this with his \NObtainment Right, from the second floor.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.07,0:17:27.26,Default,Ikusa,0,0,0,,You took off from the back door?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.26,0:17:29.44,Default,Ikusa,0,0,0,,You're quicker than I imagined.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.44,0:17:34.17,Default,Ikusa,0,0,0,,Looks like you couldn't \Nproduce enough to bury me alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.54,0:17:36.25,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,I will next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.87,0:17:38.16,Default,Ikusa,0,0,0,,You wish!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.97,0:17:53.76,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,{\i1}That "sand" was a mixture of \Npowdered iron oxide and aluminum...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.58,0:17:57.15,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,{\i1}Exposure to electricity \Nwill light it on fire.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.15,0:17:59.68,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ikusa will perish in a giant explosion.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.59,0:18:07.77,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,It's nothing but a simple chemical reaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.32,0:18:14.38,Default,Seraphiel,0,0,0,,All I did was pray...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.38,0:18:17.29,Default,Seraphiel,0,0,0,,How foolish to point your blade at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.29,0:18:19.45,Default,Seraphiel,0,0,0,,Then you shall bear it yourself:
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.45,0:18:21.20,Default,Seraphiel,0,0,0,,the wrath of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.20,0:18:22.66,Default,Seraphiel,0,0,0,,Prime Right under Production Attribute.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.66,0:18:23.85,Default,Seraphiel,0,0,0,,Weather Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.06,0:18:26.54,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,I'm gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.60,0:18:28.62,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Fuse!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.10,0:18:35.59,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,It's so dark! I can't see a thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.30,0:18:38.55,Default-Top,Knight,0,0,0,,It's pitch black! I'm scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.83,0:18:38.55,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Ryuta, what is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.55,0:18:43.02,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,{\i1}So much for firepower. \NWe're missing the brains.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.12,0:18:43.02,Default-Top,Knight,0,0,0,,It's so dark! I'm scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.57,0:18:45.02,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,{\i1}That being said...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.02,0:18:46.92,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Kazuhiko, Knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.92,0:18:49.36,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,You really willing to risk your life?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.63,0:18:52.56,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,You're asking the guy who's \Nalready blown himself up?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.56,0:18:55.82,Default,Knight,0,0,0,,You're asking the kid who's \Nalready been killed by Yagihashi?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.68,0:18:58.91,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,You're right, my bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.91,0:19:00.25,Default,Knight,0,0,0,,Destruction Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.33,0:19:08.71,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,You wouldn't wanna damage \Nthe church, would ya?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.71,0:19:10.34,Default,Seraphiel,0,0,0,,How impudent.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.34,0:19:11.96,Default,Knight,0,0,0,,Right of Flight!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.41,0:19:15.59,Default,Seraphiel,0,0,0,,Tornado!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.31,0:19:19.87,Default,Seraphiel,0,0,0,,You know better than to try that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.87,0:19:22.27,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,You sure about that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.27,0:19:23.88,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Prime Right under Production Attribute!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.88,0:19:24.98,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Explosion Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.31,0:19:26.39,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Wall of defense!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.35,0:19:29.37,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.37,0:19:30.66,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Is Knight okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.66,0:19:32.97,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,That was some tornado he wound up in...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.02,0:19:37.72,Default,Seraphiel,0,0,0,,Microburst!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.72,0:19:40.82,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,He used the downdraft to minimize damage!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.82,0:19:42.20,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,You gotta be kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.51,0:19:48.99,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Nice, Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.95,0:19:51.91,Default,Seraphiel,0,0,0,,Fine, no matter...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.28,0:19:57.55,Default,Seraphiel,0,0,0,,As long as you three die, I still win.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.03,0:19:59.76,Default,Seraphiel,0,0,0,,Hail Storm!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.16,0:20:06.67,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Kazuhiko! How many blows \Nyou got left in you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.67,0:20:08.00,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Probably two!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.00,0:20:11.04,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Great! We could use one right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.04,0:20:12.13,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.13,0:20:14.03,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Prime Right of Explosion!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.03,0:20:15.99,Default,Seraphiel,0,0,0,,Microburst!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.36,0:20:18.82,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,I knew it wouldn't work!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.12,0:20:21.09,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Just look at how jacked he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.09,0:20:23.33,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,That's besides the point bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.33,0:20:24.23,Default,Knight,0,0,0,,I'm back!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.23,0:20:25.55,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Knight, you're okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.55,0:20:27.11,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Man, you really {\i1}are{\i0} strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.83,0:20:29.87,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,We've got one shot...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.87,0:20:32.93,Default,Seraphiel,0,0,0,,I've also suffered quite a bit of damage...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.93,0:20:34.59,Default,Seraphiel,0,0,0,,Shall we wrap this up?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.59,0:20:36.05,Default,Knight,0,0,0,,Right of Flight!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.05,0:20:38.01,Default,Seraphiel,0,0,0,,I won't be fooled twice!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.01,0:20:40.22,Default,Knight,0,0,0,,Back to back! And...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.22,0:20:42.15,Default,Knight,0,0,0,,The Destruction Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.15,0:20:43.60,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Prime Right of...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.60,0:20:44.89,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Explosion!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.35,0:20:47.10,Default,Seraphiel,0,0,0,,I'll block them together!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.38,0:20:49.01,Default,Seraphiel,0,0,0,,Microburst!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.45,0:20:53.87,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,{\i1}Use his downdraft defense to accelerate!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.87,0:20:55.19,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,{\i1}Here it goes!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.78,0:21:16.01,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Got him, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.01,0:21:20.01,Next Ep Title,Sign,0,0,0,,The Battlefront
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.54,0:21:19.62,Default-Top,Ryuta,0,0,0,,The rest is up to you!
